Conclusion

This project demonstrates how Logistic Regression and statistical feature selection techniques can be used to predict lead conversion.

The project involved extensive data cleaning, categorical variable encoding, feature scaling, RFE-based feature selection, p-value analysis, VIF analysis and model evaluation.

The final model was evaluated using multiple classification metrics and tested on unseen data.

The predicted conversion probabilities can be used as a basis for prioritizing leads and supporting the sales team's lead-targeting strategy.

